  "articleBody": "An open-concept kitchen remodel can improve sightlines, shared family space, and entertaining, but removing walls affects structure, ventilation, electrical circuits, lighting, storage, and permitting. Before hiring, ask a design-build provider to verify which walls can change, how cooking odors will be exhausted, where appliances and outlets will go, and how the finished kitchen will function with adjacent rooms.",
